TIProjectTemplate.description.Project_CataTweaks_RomanNorthAmerica=Grants territorial claims throughout North America, Central America, Greenland and the Caribbean for incremental conquest. New foreign claims are hostile. Requires Great Nations and is independent of the other Roman regional projects. Completing this project grants the researching faction +10 control point capacity. Available only in Broken Earth.
