TIProjectTemplate.description.Project_CataTweaks_RomanSouthAmerica=Grants territorial claims throughout South America for incremental conquest. New foreign claims are hostile. Requires Great Nations and is independent of the other Roman regional projects. Completing this project grants the researching faction +10 control point capacity. Available only in Broken Earth.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_ImperiumSineFine=Empire Without End
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_ImperiumSineFine=Broad claims in the rest of Asia, including the Middle East, Siberia, East Asia and Southeast Asia. +10 control point capacity.
TIProjectTemplate.description.Project_ImperiumSineFine=Grants territorial claims throughout the rest of Asia, including the Middle East, Siberia, East Asia and Southeast Asia for incremental conquest. New foreign claims are hostile. Requires Great Nations and is independent of the other Roman regional projects. Completing this project grants the researching faction +10 control point capacity. Available only in Broken Earth.
